{"2422870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bronzebeard's Tavern", "steam_appid": 2422870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [3828540, 2899290, 3277600, 2800670, 2730560, 3402350, 3402360, 3650640, 3650660, 3650750], "detailed_description": "Bronzebeard's Tavern is a goofy and playful restaurant manager sim where 1-8 players can work as a team with multiplayer co-op. Fulfill a number of different roles, serve a diverse range of customers and cook up delicious dwarven cuisine.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >8-Player Multiplayer!</h2>Work together (or try) to keep the tavern running for as long as you can with seven other dwarves in online multiplayer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/50d597f2fe46ec3c3a2be4aed6c34299.poster.avif?t=1780976759\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/50d597f2fe46ec3c3a2be4aed6c34299.webm?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/50d597f2fe46ec3c3a2be4aed6c34299.mp4?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve Customers!</h2>Properly manage customer seating and orders and deliver them the correct foods to reap rewards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/aa44ff82dba504f2a4cbe30dfe7a0618.poster.avif?t=1780976759\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/aa44ff82dba504f2a4cbe30dfe7a0618.webm?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/aa44ff82dba504f2a4cbe30dfe7a0618.mp4?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cook Up and Blend Delicious Food and Drink!</h2>Prepare food for the customers upon receiving orders from your teammates, being careful not to burn anything!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/2e215f10bc9b06d257060fee270cbe7c.poster.avif?t=1780976759\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/2e215f10bc9b06d257060fee270cbe7c.webm?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/2e215f10bc9b06d257060fee270cbe7c.mp4?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your Menu!</h2>Your daily customers are always different! Design your menu however you like based on the day's forecast and food sales!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/35543a1364c42eccb7221f29612d45ca.poster.avif?t=1780976759\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/35543a1364c42eccb7221f29612d45ca.webm?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/35543a1364c42eccb7221f29612d45ca.mp4?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many Customers to Discover!</h2>There's always an unfamiliar face showing up when you're working in a tavern... can you satisfy them all?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/0d5af77e15a3ca450f2a1f0a6a30e3d6.poster.avif?t=1780976759\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/0d5af77e15a3ca450f2a1f0a6a30e3d6.webm?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/0d5af77e15a3ca450f2a1f0a6a30e3d6.mp4?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your Tavern!</h2>Build up your tavern with upgrades! These decisions change the way you play and are crucial for progressing into tougher days. Opt for more customer capacity with a shiny new expansion or utilities like more blenders or more stoves to increase your output!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/c90ad8004b25e4cf578a01bc026f6feb.poster.avif?t=1780976759\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/c90ad8004b25e4cf578a01bc026f6feb.webm?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/c90ad8004b25e4cf578a01bc026f6feb.mp4?t=1780976759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "Bronzebeard's Tavern is a goofy and playful restaurant manager sim where 1-8 players can work as a team with multiplayer co-op. Fulfill a number of different roles, serve a diverse range of customers and cook up delicious dwarven cuisine.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >8-Player Multiplayer!</h2>Work together (or try) to keep the tavern running for as long as you can with seven other dwarves in online multiplayer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2422870/extras/50d59